    "194A": {bank: {no: "1022"}, bankWhy: "interest paid by a bank, co-operative bank or post office: 1020 if the deductee is a senior citizen, 1021 if not", note: "interest other than on securities (393(1) Sl. 5(ii), 5(iii))"},
